<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine Feb inflation 1.2 pct vs 2.2 pct in Jan.</title>
<headline>Ukraine Feb inflation 1.2 pct vs 2.2 pct in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's monthly inflation rate slowed to 1.2 percent in February from 2.2 percent in January, the Statistics Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    UKRAINE CONSUMER PRICES   FEB 97   JAN 97   FEB 96</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change +1.2     +2.2     +7.4</p>
<p>The Ministry did not provide year-on-year figures.</p>
<p>Ukraine has forecast annual inflation at 25 percent in 1997 after 39.7 percent last year.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
